{"unit_id":"Fallen0543__dsh-sidebar-files#card-zh","repo":"Fallen0543/dsh-sidebar-files","commit":"00758526bd596aa208f162743391f99ec7744f63","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sidebar-files 是面向 DSH Web 的工作区文件浏览插件。它在侧边栏提供会话与文件切换，并通过插件自己的 HTTP 路由按需读取当前工作区目录，支持目录展开、隐藏项切换、复制文件路径和把文件路径作为排队提示发送给当前会话 Agent。宽侧栏可内嵌显示，窄栏或无法识别宿主结构时使用弹窗。适合需要在 DSH 会话中查看项目文件并将文件交给 Agent 阅读的用户；需要运行 DSH Web harness，无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:81-99","src/client/FileTreePanel.tsx:241-289","src/client/FileTreePanel.tsx:308-345"]}
{"unit_id":"Fallen0543__dsh-sidebar-files#card-en","repo":"Fallen0543/dsh-sidebar-files","commit":"00758526bd596aa208f162743391f99ec7744f63","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sidebar-files adds a file tree to the DSH Web sidebar. It loads folders on demand, reveals hidden items, copies file paths, and queues file-reading prompts for the current agent. Wide sidebars show it inline; narrow layouts use a modal. Requires DSH Web; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:81-99","src/client/FileTreePanel.tsx:241-289","src/client/FileTreePanel.tsx:308-345"]}
